+- `runtime/kel/backup.py` (`SNAPSHOT_KEEP`, `_prune_snapshots`, both call sites)
+- `runtime/tests/test_v16_sweep_fixes.py` (+5 tests: 2 snapshot retention, 3 actor-guard/action-family)
